  "body": "For example: https://spec.matrix.org/unstable/client-server-api/#get_matrixclientr0publicrooms\r\n\r\nThis for me (Firefox Nightly, Linux) more often than not does not scroll to the right header. Instead I'm taken a couple screen-heights up to the `GET /_matrix/client/r0/directory/list/room/{roomId}` endpoint header.\r\n\r\nI could not reproduce the behaviour in Chromium.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n - anchor",
